#: cheats.c:2822
msgid "Finds where a value (lives, health, ammo, or with Size 2 bytes a score) is kept. 1. First Scan. 2. Change it in the game (lose a life ...). 3. Choose Compare (and Value), click Next Scan; repeat until a few addresses are left. 4. Select one, type the value to hold in Set to, Add Cheat."
